WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:16.561
Thumbelina and Pete were in trouble.

2
00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:22.616
"Thumbelina, go back to my house!" Mrs. Gray yelled.

3
00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:27.902
"Slim? Down here!" Mr. Rufus shouted.

4
00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:32.100
"Mr. Rufus, please," begged Thumbelina.

5
00:00:32.101 --> 00:00:34.741
"The bird is my friend."

6
00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:38.522
Mr. Rufus waved his cane.

7
00:00:38.523 --> 00:00:40.475
"I promised Slim.

8
00:00:40.476 --> 00:00:45.297
And I always keep my promises," he said firmly.

9
00:00:45.298 --> 00:00:48.478
"Go put on your dress, Thumbelina,"

10
00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:51.725
said Mrs. Gray, looking at her watch.

11
00:00:51.726 --> 00:00:55.236
"It's almost time for the wedding."

12
00:00:55.237 --> 00:01:01.292
"I won't marry him!" Thumbelina shouted.

13
00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:06.079
Then Mrs. Gray saw the dress on the ground.

14
00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:09.758
It was covered in food and mud.

15
00:01:09.759 --> 00:01:15.710
"Thumbelina, is that your wedding dress?" she gasped.

16
00:01:15.711 --> 00:01:18.177
She held up the dress.

17
00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:24.237
"It's ruined! And you gave this bird my food?"

18
00:01:24.238 --> 00:01:29.540
"Well, that was a waste of time," grunted the mole.

19
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.493
"Slim is going to eat him anyway."

20
00:01:32.494 --> 00:01:39.994
Suddenly a big hairy paw pushed down through the hole.

21
00:01:39.995 --> 00:01:44.046
"Smells like that bird is alive, Rufus!

22
00:01:44.047 --> 00:01:49.509
All the better!" growled Slim.

23
00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:54.410
Pete stared at the coyote's sharp claws above him.

24
00:01:54.411 --> 00:01:57.369
He froze with fear.

25
00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.765
Thumbelina had to think fast.

26
00:02:00.766 --> 00:02:04.508
The coyote was almost through the hole.

27
00:02:04.509 --> 00:02:09.749
Thumbelina had an idea and began to sing to Pete.

28
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:15.329
"Pete, listen to me," she sang.

29
00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:19.713
"Huh? What?" Pete stared at Thumbelina.

30
00:02:19.714 --> 00:02:22.063
He looked confused.

31
00:02:22.064 --> 00:02:25.113
"Where did you learn that song?"

32
00:02:25.114 --> 00:02:31.138
Thumbelina remembered the secret talking songs from Kris and Maggie.

33
00:02:31.139 --> 00:02:32.948
She was singing:

34
00:02:32.949 --> 00:02:36.751
"I will wave my wedding dress.

35
00:02:36.752 --> 00:02:40.739
The coyote will be confused.

36
00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:46.697
Then quickly fly up as fast as you can.

37
00:02:46.698 --> 00:02:51.164
I'll hang onto you."

38
00:02:51.165 --> 00:02:55.937
"It's too dangerous," said Pete.

39
00:02:55.938 --> 00:03:01.297
"How can you sing at a time like this?" cried Mrs. Gray.

40
00:03:01.298 --> 00:03:06.563
"She does have such a pretty voice." Mr. Rufus sighed.

41
00:03:06.564 --> 00:03:10.770
He was moving his cane in time with the song.

42
00:03:10.771 --> 00:03:14.215
Thumbelina sang the song again.

43
00:03:14.216 --> 00:03:16.808
She stared at Pete.

44
00:03:16.809 --> 00:03:22.193
"Are you sure?" he asked.

45
00:03:22.194 --> 00:03:27.285
"We can do it!" sang Thumbelina.

46
00:03:27.286 --> 00:03:31.158
"Now, Pete!" she shouted.

47
00:03:31.159 --> 00:03:34.769
Thumbelina grabbed the dress from Mrs. Gray.

48
00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.001
She swung it around.

49
00:03:37.002 --> 00:03:40.940
The nuts and seeds went flying in the air.

50
00:03:40.941 --> 00:03:43.989
Some nuts fell on the mouse and the mole.

51
00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.230
"Ow!" they cried.

52
00:03:47.231 --> 00:03:50.876
Thumbelina let the dress go.

53
00:03:50.877 --> 00:03:55.238
The wind caught the dress and blew it toward Slim.

54
00:03:55.239 --> 00:04:01.135
"At last!" Slim said hungrily.

55
00:04:01.136 --> 00:04:03.341
He bit the dress.

56
00:04:03.342 --> 00:04:07.394
"Pete!" Thumbelina shouted loudly.

57
00:04:07.395 --> 00:04:12.252
Pete spread his wings and shot up straight through the hole.

58
00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:14.900
Thumbelina grabbed his leg.

59
00:04:14.901 --> 00:04:18.649
"What? This isn't a bird!"

60
00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.271
Slim realized his mistake.

61
00:04:21.272 --> 00:04:24.484
But it was too late.

62
00:04:24.485 --> 00:04:30.973
"Thumbelina!" shouted Mrs. Gray and Mr. Rufus from the tunnel.

63
00:04:30.974 --> 00:04:42.241
"My dinner!" shouted Slim, jumping up and down.
